{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこ？観て頂いた方はご存知かとは思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは選抜メンバーから落ちてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何より申し訳ない気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のチャリティーイベントの時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席から聞こえる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あみあみー！！！」　という声。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞こえるたびに涙が込み上げそうになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうしてあみの事を応援してくださる皆様を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の放送で悲しませてしまう事になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その事がすごく辛い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにあみから離れていってしまうんではないか、とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなことが想い浮んで悲しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもだからと言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりあみを応援して頂いてる皆様に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へこたれてる、あみの姿は絶対に見せたくない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっとあみが頑張っている姿をたくさん見て欲しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーはまた入れ代わりがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時、あみは劣化しちゃったから駄目だね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言われないように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみらしく楽しい気持ちを忘れずに緊張していたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っていたいです。・・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて絶対に頑張るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの事、応援しててくれたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、今の現状にしっかり真っ正面から向き合って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長していきたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族の皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかこれからも能條愛未を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"}],"source":"archive"}